      "note": "Bound for Tormente aboard the Tide of Memory, Pieter uncovers the dragon-gold Foxglove smuggled from the Carnac cave; Dagmar mind-reads the truth and the ship detours to London to recover three coins already fenced. The party then rows back to Tormente near Carnac: the dragon dismisses the Roman coin as 'debris,' asks Dagmar to broker its sale, and lets them past into the regio — a tidal sauna-cave (Magic aura 7) and, beyond it, a seven-planet conjunction lock. Valdemar's Storm Dragon sails the dragon leg alongside. (Other ships shown at their standing bases — no named errand this season.)",
